	"FriendlyName": "Script Core",
	"Description": "Host-agnostic TypeScript runtime: it owns the script VM, the script roots, hot reload and one JSON event channel. It knows nothing about combat, interaction or GAS -- gameplay layers publish their own reflected API for scripts to call.",
